✔ P2-2 conditional selection oracle checks every target and leaves uncompiled reviewer conditions unassessed (125.435ms)
✔ E1 replay seeds retain both real h001 decisions and leave conditional proposals unscored (83.566833ms)
✔ replay excludeCandidateIds rejects intersections and accepts disjoint candidate sets (0.217959ms)
✔ replay candidateIdsExact compares sets independently of order and rejects missing or extra candidates (0.068167ms)
✔ replay rejects unknown match fields rather than ignoring their requirements (0.204166ms)
✔ replay validates every matching alternative before any model call (2.557667ms)
✔ P1-B original replay preserves complete captured messages and counts the failed call once (10.582333ms)
✔ P1-B static saved DOM uses current Executor targets with scripts and external requests disabled (1382.491584ms)
✔ C1 injection preserves captured goals and targets and limits history to six steps in the same read (7.053959ms)
